<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apollo Group rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apollo Group rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said analyst Robert Peterson initiated coverage of Apollo Group Inc, which runs education programs for working adults, with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-1/16 to 32-13/16.</p>
</text>
